            "html": "<p>Both rates are still expressed as deaths per 1,000 people per year. With a common age composition, <strong>B now has the lower summary rate</strong>. No observed death was erased, and nobody was secretly transferred between provinces. We asked a <em>different comparative question</em>: what summary rates would these age-specific patterns yield under the same chosen age distribution?</p>"
