    "reflectionTitle": "A question to carry forward",
    "reflection": "<p>Two districts report the same number of hospital admissions, but one has twice the population. A third district has the lowest overall admission rate, but the highest rate among older residents. Before saying which district is “healthier,” identify the numerator, the appropriate exposure denominator, the time period, and the demographic groups you need to examine. Then explain in two sentences why even an age-standardized comparison would not prove which district has better healthcare.</p>",
